Package: nimbuscore
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: gr1m <bl4ck4mi@gmail.com>
Description: NimbusCore container orchestrator (apiserver, agent, CLI)
 From-scratch, Kubernetes-inspired container orchestrator: Raft consensus,
 mTLS via SPIFFE, non-bypassable admission control, and a kubectl-style
 CLI (nimbusctl). Installs nimbus-apiserver and nimbus-agent as systemd
 services, plus the nimbusctl client, all under /usr/bin.
